caption: Vampire Field Manual — ☕ What Counts as a Vampire?
campaign-component: what-counts-as-a-vampire

For operational purposes, “vampire” refers to any sapient entity that sustains itself via the direct consumption of magical, biological, or metaphysical life energy from living beings, usually by consumption of blood.

Sub-categories include (but are not limited to):

Arcane Vampires: Magic-dependent predators; most common.

Biological Vampires: Pathogenic or genetic; technically alive.

